      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>How to use</b>

    1. Open  Tools > Easy Thai Font Adjustment  (or
    right-click a TMP Font Asset > Easy Thai Font Adjustment).

    2. Assign your
    TMP Font Asset and click  "Fix Everything Automatically".  Values are calculated
    from the font size.

    3. Try it here: assign  ''NotoSansThai-Regular SDF (Before)'' 
    from Assets/Poppod/DemoScene - the left column will update to match the right.

    Requires
    TMP Essential Resources (Window > TextMeshPro > Import TMP Essential Resources).
    Full docs: Assets/Poppod/Documentations.'
